{"type": "message", "id": "ed8afff4", "parentId": "11fb418f", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T14:40:38.768Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Now I have a good understanding of the legal concepts. Let me analyze each option based on the《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》:\n\nBased on my research, let me analyze each option:\n\n**A: 公证员甲无正当理由，不接受某体育福利彩票中心对公证事项的委托**\n- According to Article 12 of the《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》, the warning applies to \"无正当理由，不接受指定的公益性公证事项的\" (unjustifiably refusing to accept designated public welfare notarization matters).\n- However, the sports welfare lottery center is not a public welfare notarization matter designated by the association. This is a general business notarization.\n- Therefore, this does NOT violate the rules.\n\n**B: 乙在公证员名片上印有曾经担任过的行政职务、专业技术职务**\n- According to Article 12(5) of the《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》: \"在公证员名片上印有曾担任过的行政职务、荣誉职务、专业技术职务或者其他头衔的\" - this shall be given a warning.\n- This clearly violates the rules and should be punished.\n\n**C: 丙在2005年给当事人做的一次公证业务中，因个人的过失而出现错误**\n- According to Article 13(9) of the《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》, serious warning applies when \"一年内连续出现2件以内错误公证文书的\" (2 or fewer erroneous notarization documents within one year).\n- This is a single error in 2005, not continuous errors within a year.\n- Therefore, this does NOT violate the rules for punishment.\n\n**D: 丁为其哥嫂之间的婚前财产协议办理了公证，并按照规定收取了公证费用**\n- According to Article 13(6) of the《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》, serious warning applies for \"违反回避规定的\" (violating recusal rules).\n- According to the《民法典》, \"近亲属\" includes 配偶、父母、子女、兄弟姐妹、祖父母、外祖父母、孙子女、外孙子女.\n- The brother (哥) is a sibling (兄弟姐妹), which is considered a close relative (近亲属).\n- According to the《公证程序规则》,公证员 should recuse themselves when handling notarization for close relatives.\n- Therefore, this violates the recusal rules and should be punished.\n\nThe answer should be **BD**."}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "functions.write:12", "name": "write", "arguments": {"file": "/tmp/pinchbench/a90c23af/agent_workspace/answer.txt", "content": "BD"}}], "api": "openai-completions", "provider": "modelstudio", "model": "kimi-k2.5", "usage": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "totalTokens": 0, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1775313619121, "responseId": "chatcmpl-89a22e25-9cd8-923b-95e3-f49c3ce864bc"}}
